function addLine(prefill=false){lineCount++;let ex=[["repair","front bumper","","1","","","","2","2","2"],["repair","RH rear door","","1","","","","2","1","1"],["repair","RH quarter panel","","1","","","","2","1","1"],["paint","wheel molding","","2","","","","","",""]],e=prefill?ex[lineCount-1]:["","","","1","","","","","",""];lineItems.insertAdjacentHTML("beforeend",`<tr><td>${lineCount}</td><td><input value="${e[0]||''}"></td><td><input value="${e[1]||''}"></td><td><input value="${e[2]||''}"></td><td><input value="${e[3]||''}"></td><td><input value="${e[4]||''}" oninput="sumLineHours()"></td><td><input value="${e[5]||''}" oninput="sumLineHours()"></td><td><input value="${e[6]||''}" oninput="sumLineHours()"></td><td><input value="${e[7]||''}" oninput="sumLineHours()"></td><td><input value="${e[8]||''}" oninput="sumLineHours()"></td><td><input value="${e[9]||''}" oninput="sumLineHours()"></td></tr>`);sumLineHours()}
